; The SHIPPED SMT-LIB2 printer. Stdlib-only over oxsmt_core + oxsmt_lexical (both
; stdlib-only, so the firewall / I3 holds): the printer's quoting decision is grounded in
; the one shared lexer (ADR-0008) so it cannot disagree with any reader on a token boundary.
;
; The printer is the only thing that ships. The test-only PARSER is a separate library
; (parser/), never listed here and never depended on by shipped code, so it cannot be
; linked into the compiler artifact (DESIGN.md §3). Keeping the parser out of this
; directory's library makes that boundary mechanically checkable.

(library
 (name oxsmt_smtlib)
 (libraries oxsmt_core oxsmt_lexical))
